      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>As a bonus action, the inferno douses itself in fuel and lights itself on fire. When a creature or vehicle starts its turn within 5 feet of the inferno while it is on fire, it takes 10 (3d6) fire damage. A creature or vehicle that touches the inferno or hits it with a melee attack while within 5 feet of it takes 10 (3d6) fire damage. The fire is extinguished if a gallon of water is splashed on the inferno, or if an effect would extinguish flames in the inferno's space.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
